Package: CTTB
Type: Package
Title: Estimate Aggregated and Conditional Trimming Bounds Using Covariates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Cyrus", family = "Samii", email = "cds2083@nyu.edu", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Ye", family = "Wang", email = "yewang@unc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person(given = c("Junlong", "Aaron"), family = "Zhou", email = "jlzhou@nyu.edu", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Tools to estimate covariate-tightened trimming bounds for
    treatment effects with endogenous outcome missingness or sample selection.
    The methods extend Lee's trimming bounds by using generalized random
    forests to incorporate high-dimensional covariates, estimate conditional
    bounds, and aggregate them into tighter identified sets.
